# Synthetic test data in pci.ids format, written for Homelab Control (not an excerpt of the PCI ID
# Repository). Vendor/device IDs are arbitrary test values; names are invented.
f0e1  Example Vendor (synthetic)
	0a01  Example Device Without Driver (synthetic)
	0a02  Example SATA Controller (synthetic)
		f0e1 0001  Example Subsystem (synthetic, ignored by the parser)
f0e2  Second Example Vendor (synthetic)
	0b01  Unrelated Device (synthetic)
C 00  Synthetic class section (ends vendor parsing)
f0e3  Vendor After Class Section (must not be parsed)
